comments.body:
@jamorham thanks a lot for the response and for your willingness to discuss these issues with the foundation.
I understand your concerns, I'm an Android developer myself and am also annoyed by some of the new policies Google enforces on us recently. Still, Play Store availability would be a huge plus for my dad, as he can't install xDrip on his new work phone while it's not on Google Play.
Would it for example be possible to strip out the emergency feature on the Google Play version only? About the targetApi, what are the specific issues that happen with the new APIs? I'd be ready to help and test wherever I can.
